or, la sorella di Freddie Kashmira Bulsara, i suoi amici Anita Dobson e David Wigg e il suo collaboratore Peter Freestone, il documentario non solo racconta quegli ultimi 5 anni di vita del cantante ma anche come il concerto tributo al Wembley Stadium organizzato dai Queen il 20 aprile 1992, pochi mesi dopo la morte di Freddie, che ha contribuito a cambiare l’opinione della società su una malattia considerata, fino a quel momento, uno stigma di cui vergognarsi."},{"id":443762,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":25884,"locale":"it","key":"release_date","value":"2022-04-20"},{"id":443761,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":25884,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"freddie-mercury-limmortale"},{"id":443764,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":25884,"locale":"it","key":"views","value":"14"}],"keywords":[{"id":51,"name":"1980s","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:51.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":51}},{"id":1146,"name":"1990s","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:54:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:54:19.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":1146}},{"id":2243,"name":"singing","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:00:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:00:00.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":2243}},{"id":3273,"name":"aids","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:06:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:06:20.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":3273}},{"id":3275,"name":"rock band","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:06:21.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:06:21.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":3275}},{"id":9347,"name":"music documentary","created_at":"2023-09-29T15:40:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-09-29T15:40:39.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":9347}},{"id":9849,"name":"archive footage","created_at":"2023-12-22T17:53:02.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-12-22T17:53:02.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":25884,"keyword_id":9849}},{"id":11525,"name":"celebrity i